-- NLC: "Shaders" options panel ( SSS 23 passes: Build A AO / IL / contact shadows, Build B water, reflections,
-- volumetric resolution, fog scattering, foliage, glass ).
-- Opened with the Shaders button of the Video tab ( left of Advanced ). Same row model as
-- ui_mm_opt_video_adv.script: engine console variables bound through options_item
-- ( group mm_opt_video_shaders: OGSR resets the restart flag only for groups named mm_opt_video* )
-- in ui_mm_opt.xml <tab_shaders>. The effect switches ( AO type/quality, indirect light, contact
-- shadows ) live here too, at the top of their sections.

